# Same bytes on every platform. Windows Git defaults to core.autocrlf=true
# (GitHub's Windows runners too), which would check out CRLF sources: the
# SDK, the examples and the docs are copied into the packages as they are,
# and tests compare generated text. Keep LF everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never touch them.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.gba binary
*.sav binary
